# Day 13/60 — AI-Powered Job Discovery with Claude Connectors

## Objective

Learn how Claude Connectors can be used to connect AI with real-world job opportunities and market insights.

## Task

1. Connect Claude with Indeed
2. Create a professional profile
3. Define job search criteria
4. Discover matching opportunities
5. Review match scores
6. Analyze skill gaps
7. Review market demand insights

## What I Learned

### AI Can Search Beyond Conversations

Instead of only generating responses, Claude can interact with connected platforms and help discover relevant opportunities.

### Job Search Can Be Data-Driven

By analyzing:

* Job descriptions
* Match scores
* Required skills
* Market demand

Claude can provide deeper insights than a traditional job search.

### Skill Gaps Become Visible

The analysis highlighted:

* Existing strengths
* Missing skills
* Learning priorities
* Career opportunities

## Biggest Insight

Applying to more jobs is not always the answer.

Applying to the right jobs while improving the right skills is a much better strategy.

## Key Takeaway

AI + Real-Time Data + Career Goals = Smarter Job Search

